abstract: >-
  GenomeAgent is a resource-aware autonomous agent for genome assembly.
  Given reads, biological context and an objective, it searches for the
  best scientifically defensible strategy that fits the available
  machine through an observe, plan, estimate, execute, evaluate and
  replan loop. A Python harness is the authority on resources, policy,
  state, validation and provenance.
